  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Independent Invention, Tech sphere, Drone.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Your independent inventions are considered drones for purposes from benefiting from effects that affect drones, and vice versa. In addition as independent inventions you can select Drones as a base form (these independent inventions don’t count towards the maximum number of Hit Dice of drones you may maintain). Your independent inventions can be activated or deactivated as if they where drones.</p>\n<p>You may also apply improvements and technical insights to your drones (1 improvement for every 10 levels of technician you possess (minimum 0)).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/practitioner-feats#toc121\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
